00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.580
I don't know why I thought to read it.

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:07.920
I think I was just checking to see how, like, how it works with more than one player.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:17.080
Uh, so I was going to the manual, but it's very like in the same style as the host of the show, that kind of person talking to you about the stuff in the manual.

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:24.180
Cause you know, usually we get like, don't leave your game on for this amount of time and like very things that like are required by people.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:31.820
But instead this one had like, uh, you know, press start when you see the legal mumbo jumbo on the screen.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:32.640
It's like, okay.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.040
Like that's, that's funny.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.020
That's funny. Yeah.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.020
It's funny enough.

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:39.180
And I think that's another thing I want to get into is like, it's funny enough.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:47.560
The show, the show, you know, give or take, maybe the humor didn't age that well, but like the actual video game just isn't funny enough period.

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:52.880
Like, it's not like it, it's not like the jokes just don't land because we don't understand them.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:55.140
