There's a lot of soap opera stuff.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:23.300
That was the strangest part because it's like MTV doesn't even have a hand in those kinds of things.

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:32.400
So it's not, you know, their audience isn't watching soap operas and they're not like owned yet by anybody who was like, you know, making affiliate soap operas.

